{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>For by me</b> — the words of Wisdom, who is speaking." "And the meaning of <b>for by me</b> — is like 'because of me and through my cause your days will multiply.'" "<b>And they will add to you</b> — they explained it as referring back to fear and knowledge, which were mentioned. And it is possible that <b>and they will add to you</b> is elided as a verb-form, like: <b>ויקבר אותו בגיא</b> (Deuteronomy 34:6), and the meaning concerns the particulars of wisdoms and disciplines, for they add years of life, as in the sense of: <b>כי היא חייך ואורך ימיך</b> (Proverbs 4:13, 'for she is your life and the length of your days')."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:44.313409345Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}